      "content": "thanks. we also have a bit of an issue with the corners of some of the stacks looking a bit uneven sometimes. we've had a few close calls with things shifting or looking like they're about to lean just a little bit out of alignment. is that usually just a weight distribution thing or could there be something else causing that kind of sudden instability?",
