    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "yeah i'll check the floor and the pallets. it's just weird because everything seems fine one minute and then suddenly it looks like something's just... off. almost like the load has been messed with or something. do you think it's possible for external vibrations or even just the way the forklift driver moves could cause that kind of sudden, unpredictable shift in the load?",
